        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-04T09:54:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ahh, Hunter and Hunted. Okay, now it makes sense :). And yeah, Unforgiving Wasteland is the only time when a hero being defeated would result in something other than them flipping, because the card specifically states that it overrides the normal \"on destruction\" action. Otherwise, assume all heroes have the text \"When this card would be destroyed, flip it instead\" :).</p>",
